  "reviews": [
    {
      "game": "FATAL FURY: City of the Wolves Revenge Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/23633/450x258/fatal-fury-city-of-the-wolves-revenge-edition-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1795557600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/23633-buy-fatal-fury-city-of-the-wolves-revenge-edition-pc-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-5e6cd8f",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "dislike",
      "content": "Easy to understand why the game is so cheap even at full price. really ugly, the UI is horrible, they create new characters from a lot of franchises to raise the hype around this game, they put some 1M cash prize in competitions, but it's not a good game. Even the lengendary characters from this mythical serie like Mai are a failure.\n\n\n\nTechnically speaking, the game runs smoothly on an old computer, far better than SF6 or even MK11"
    },
    {
      "game": "Until Then",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/15891/450x258/until-then-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1795557600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/15891-buy-until-then-pc-steam/",
      "user": "NyxHemera",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/31562928-1779908254.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Until Then is a beautifully crafted narrative adventure that stands out thanks to its exceptional storytelling and breathtaking artistic direction.\n\n\n\nSet in a world that feels both ordinary and quietly mysterious, the game follows the life of a teenager whose everyday routine gradually unravels into a deeply emotional and thought-provoking journey.\n\n\n\nWhat truly makes Until Then unforgettable is its masterful storytelling.\n\n\n\nEvery conversation, character interaction, and seemingly insignificant moment contributes to a rich, emotional narrative that explores themes of friendship, loss, identity, and the passage of time.\n\n\n\nThe writing is subtle and authentic, allowing players to form genuine connections with the characters while uncovering the story's many layers.\n\n\n\nThe game's art direction is equally remarkable. Its stunning pixel art blends nostalgic charm with modern visual techniques, creating vibrant environments filled with atmosphere and emotion.\n\n\n\nCombined with expressive animations, dynamic lighting, and a carefully crafted soundtrack, Until Then delivers an immersive experience that is as visually captivating as it is emotionally powerful.\n\n\n\nOverall, Until Then is much more than a story-driven game—it's a memorable emotional experience that showcases how outstanding storytelling and sublime artistic design can come together to create something truly special."
    },
    {
      "game": "Silver Pines",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/17460/450x258/silver-pines-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1795557600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/17460-buy-silver-pines-pc-steam/",
      "user": "Keibo",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/4801525-1641982368.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Great spooky game, with an incredible atmosphere reminding me of Twin Peaks, Alan Wake and Silent Hill 2. \n\nThe story and the lore behind it are both a bit nebulous but the experience was still pretty fun, especially for someone not used to horror games. Gameplay reminds me of Resident Evil in some way. \n\n\n\nIf you like indie games, spooky games, mystery games or RE games, this might be for you!\n\n\n\n(& nominated in the TGA! Great job Wytch Elm)"
    },
